{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5691938bf3b57dac80f5f6232d21ecf475447f0040a220291ce54b6fc2154fe1", "ja": "（茜からファンの人たちに感謝を込めた\nバレンタインチョコのお渡しイベントは大盛況だ！）", "zh": "（茜向粉丝们表达感谢、赠送情人节巧克力的活动大获成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "386c13a0fb7abfc323ea856bf0c8b1506c7a043a836d9cd4673b1a08684ef144", "ja": "ハッピー・バレンタイン！　茜ちゃんから、\nファンのみんなへ、とっておきのプレゼントだよ～！", "zh": "情人节快乐！这是小茜送给粉丝们的特别礼物哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "959ca8207b639bc42e12ae8a1df0e190bb8c0e077a14fd0c2cb4d8f8c2e28c7a", "ja": "はいは～い、押さないでー！　みんなの分は\nちゃ～んと用意してあるから、安心してね☆", "zh": "好啦好啦～别推啊！大家的份我都已经好好准备好了，放心吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5f9ebb974c7666742bc609bfe54ee1bd7a432e129f814365c9c783c1ba976dfe", "ja": "お渡し会、お疲れ様。\nファンの人たち、すごい喜んでくれてたな！", "zh": "辛苦了，参加这次赠送会。\n粉丝们都特别开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "7bae2a45cea4eec281f0dda0263f895bb59f020aef7d6efa719747b33c07748f", "ja": "そりゃ、そうだよ！　なんたって、世界一カワイイ\n茜ちゃんから、直接チョコをもらえるんだから！", "zh": "那当然啦！毕竟能从世界第一可爱的小茜那里直接收到巧克力嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "e6b44a4fdc09ba5b88c6f00587c207b2e16a4b480c932b8e9dfc27edf49a3e19", "ja": "し・か・も！　一つ一つ、茜ちゃんが丁寧にラッピング\nして、直筆メッセージまで封入するオマケ付き！", "zh": "而・且！每一份都由小茜亲手精心包装，还附赠亲笔留言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "9f974b11d9fc4dd975293770e3834ded2a59d7ac774f40bac7c593b262b6e173", "ja": "これはもう家宝にして、代々受け継がなきゃね♪", "zh": "这已经是传家宝了，必须世代传下去才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1007_p", "source_sha256": "adabe5c1c278a88bbfa79f5646057b325b21d8391b4e27ccee71b477423ba992", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nまあ、チョコは早めに食べてもらいたいけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n不过，我还是希望你能早点把巧克力吃掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bed288101378e09c094cf6658c8b354b203c2e5b4036e20e1bab2710fde7af5f", "ja": "泣いて喜んでる人もいたし、ファンの人には\n一生忘れられないイベントになったな。", "zh": "也有人喜极而泣，对粉丝们来说，这成了终生难忘的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "a600e997f5e72ac4260f9c171c0c9b88c9c13bba6f46f324380c93b4be07c165", "ja": "にゃはは☆　そうだね！　あ、でも……\n{$P$}ちゃん、並ばなくて大丈夫？", "zh": "喵哈哈☆是啊！啊，不过……\n{$P$}，不用排队也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "27265c51bb7832961012279d0ae007d9cdaad743ae7204d7df220b8f5f807806", "ja": "喜ぶファンを横目に「いいなぁ、茜ちゃんのチョコ\n欲しいなぁ」って思ったよね？　絶対そうだよね？", "zh": "看到粉丝们开开心心的样子，你是不是在一旁想着“真好啊，我也想要小茜的巧克力啊”？肯定是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f0b7f3bbf6faeb58463c06990092f002cf3d583e65188abca5be02f8da78d2de", "ja": "いや。そんな風に思ったりはしてない……ぞ？\n多分……。", "zh": "不是。我才没有那么想……吧？\n大概……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e3320a67a1e6588c633fa02d68c13a2b9f2871d2b58834f43d40c2b1b45ec27", "ja": "照れなくてもいいのに～！　本当は欲しかったけど、\n恥ずかしくて並べなかっただけでしょ？", "zh": "不用害羞嘛～！其实是想要的，只是因为害羞才没排队，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c81c832ae7a9e172616b38ee75fce7c97c17caca9117256ff2cebc4804c89bd9", "ja": "……。そう、かも……？", "zh": "……也许……是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9307e2cbebbdba958b3403ed50536a3f0335424317736309c7d22dafa326293", "ja": "ふっふっふっ……そんな、恥ずかしがり屋な\n{$P$}ちゃんに朗報です！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……对于这么害羞的\n{$P$}，有个好消息告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0513_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "ff30017eab80cf7f0333367b3bec2ddf1a93a3c15673db98f8abe20dbe44fe4c", "ja": "茜ちゃんがとっておきのチョコを用意しておきました！\n{$P$}ちゃん、楽しみにしててね♪", "zh": "小茜准备了珍藏的巧克力！\n{$P$}，敬请期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
